        <mxCell id="shape-equation" value="代回 \(\frac{\partial\ell}{\partial\beta}=0\)，得 \(g(\beta;\gamma)=0\)&lt;br&gt;\(g=\frac1\beta+\frac1n\sum_{i=1}^{n}\ln y_i\)&lt;br&gt;\(\quad-\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n}y_i^\beta\ln y_i}{\sum_{i=1}^{n}y_i^\beta}\)" vertex="1" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=10;strokeColor=#337695;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#243449;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=27;spacing=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1.8;" renderRole="method">
